{"id":"84333fc892f1be29","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-ricci-flat.md","title":"Ricci Flat","display":"df-ricci-flat — Ricci Flat","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ricci-flat","aliases":["58-df-ricci-flat","Ricci Flat"],"display":"df-ricci-flat — Ricci Flat","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-ricci-curvature.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ricci-flat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ricci-flat</span><span>Ricci Flat</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ricci-flat — Ricci Flat"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" href=\"?note=04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold.md\">../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0b88ba4114f012c8\" href=\"?note=0b88ba4114f012c8\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-ricci-curvature.md\">../batch20/58-df-ricci-curvature.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f810bf542334e0d1\" href=\"?note=f810bf542334e0d1\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md\">../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,g\\in V\">\\(M,g\\in V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\langle\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb R,S,r,A,O,\\mathcal T\\rangle\">\\(D=\\langle\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb R,S,r,A,O,\\mathcal T\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\">\\(S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\\)</span> 采用 <code>58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data</code> 的记录格式；量词中的分量表示当前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 的投影。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RicciGeometryData}_{58}\">\\(\\mathrm{RicciGeometryData}_{58}\\)</span> 由 <code>58-df-ricci-curvature</code> 定义，包含同一度量的 Levi–Civita 联络、曲率和收缩。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(S,p)\">\\(T(S,p)\\)</span> 是当前结构的切空间。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f810bf542334e0d1\" href=\"?note=f810bf542334e0d1\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md\">../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RicciFlatMetric}\">\\(\\mathrm{RicciFlatMetric}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ricci\\text{-}flat}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\quad\n\\mathrm{RicciFlatMetric}_S(M,g)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi,E,D,j,\\nabla,R,\\rho,e,n,S\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb R)\n\\land S=\\operatorname{pr}_4(D)\\land\\mathrm{RicciGeometryData}_{58}(\\rho,R,\\nabla,g,e,n,D,j)\\hspace{2mm}\\\\\n\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall v,w\\in T(S,p)\\;\\rho(p)(\\langle v,w\\rangle)=0\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ricci\\text{-}flat}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\quad\n\\mathrm{RicciFlatMetric}_S(M,g)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi,E,D,j,\\nabla,R,\\rho,e,n,S\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb R)\n\\land S=\\operatorname{pr}_4(D)\\land\\mathrm{RicciGeometryData}_{58}(\\rho,R,\\nabla,g,e,n,D,j)\\hspace{2mm}\\\\\n\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall v,w\\in T(S,p)\\;\\rho(p)(\\langle v,w\\rangle)=0\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>零曲率收缩属于由同一 g 确定的 Levi–Civita 联络；不再借助未定义的 Ric^g 或张量空间零元记号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Joyce, Compact Manifolds with Special Holonomy</li>\n<li>Besse, Einstein Manifolds</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"04b9f5c6479b7ecd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-ricci-curvature.md","status":"resolved","id":"0b88ba4114f012c8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-ricci-curvature.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"f810bf542334e0d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"f810bf542334e0d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}$ 取 [[../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,g\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"D=\\langle\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb R,S,r,A,O,\\mathcal T\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RicciGeometryData}_{58}","display":false},{"tex":"T(S,p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RicciFlatMetric}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ricci\\text{-}flat}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\quad\n\\mathrm{RicciFlatMetric}_S(M,g)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi,E,D,j,\\nabla,R,\\rho,e,n,S\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb R)\n\\land S=\\operatorname{pr}_4(D)\\land\\mathrm{RicciGeometryData}_{58}(\\rho,R,\\nabla,g,e,n,D,j)\\hspace{2mm}\\\\\n\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall v,w\\in T(S,p)\\;\\rho(p)(\\langle v,w\\rangle)=0\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1809,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1091","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-ricci-flat.md|58-df-ricci-flat]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["04b9f5c6479b7ecd","0b88ba4114f012c8","f810bf542334e0d1"]}